              <div class="col-md-8" role="main">

                            
                            
                            
                            
                                              
  
<p class="text-align-center"><a target="_blank"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://public.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFDA/subscriber/new?topic_id=USFDA_661" target="_blank"><span><a target="_blank"><span class="text">Sign up for Drug Supply Chain Security Act email updates</span></a></span></a></a></p><h2>DSCSA Policies</h2><p>FDA has issued the following guidance and policy documents since the <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-113publ54/pdf/PLAW-113publ54.pdf" target="_blank">Drug Supply Chain Security Act (DSCSA)</a>&nbsp;was enacted in 2013.</p><p>Visit <a href="/drugs/drug-supply-chain-security-act-dscsa/fdas-implementation-drug-supply-chain-security-act-dscsa-requirements" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="29090898-d1f8-4935-96a8-f4d794c07185" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="FDA’s Implementation of Drug Supply Chain Security Act (DSCSA) Requirements">FDA’s implementation of DSCSA requirements</a> and <a href="/drugs/drug-supply-chain-security-act-dscsa/public-health-emergencies-and-dscsa-requirements" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="733d717c-189b-41d9-a857-98171734d55d" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Public Health Emergencies and DSCSA Requirements">public health emergencies and DSCSA requirements</a> for more information.</p><div class="inset-column"><div class="lcds-datatable lcds-datatable--ckeditor"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped" data-column-defs="[{ &quot;targets&quot;: 0, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;date&quot; }]" data-excel-button="true" data-order="[ 0, &quot;desc&quot; ]" data-paging="true" data-searching="true" summary="Newly Added Guidances"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Date Published</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Title</th><th scope="col">Additional Information</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>6/12/2024</td><td>Notice</td><td><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2024/06/12/2024-12857/implementing-interoperable-systems-and-processes-for-enhanced-drug-distribution-security">Implementing Interoperable Systems and Processes for Enhanced Drug Distribution Security Requirements Under the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act; Notice; Request for Information and Comments; Reopening of the Comment Period</a></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>12/6/2023</td><td>Final Guidance</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/verification-systems-under-drug-supply-chain-security-act-certain-prescription-drugs" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1b0afff6-41f9-4c98-9b60-ed75857c782e" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Verification Systems Under the Drug Supply Chain Security Act for Certain Prescription Drugs">Verification Systems Under the Drug Supply Chain Security Act for Certain Prescription Drugs</a></td><td><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/12/07/2023-26846/verification-systems-under-the-drug-supply-chain-security-act-for-certain-prescription-drugs">Notice of Availability</a></td></tr><tr><td>11/20/2023</td><td>Notice</td><td><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/11/20/2023-25609/implementing-interoperable-systems-and-processes-for-enhanced-drug-distribution-security">Implementing Interoperable Systems and Processes for Enhanced Drug Distribution Security Requirements; Request for Information and Comments</a></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td>9/6/2023</td><td>Final Guidance</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/dscsa-standards-interoperable-exchange-information-tracing-certain-human-finished-prescription-drugs" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5360c825-7c35-4ef6-b820-217e91803979" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="DSCSA Standards for the Interoperable Exchange of Information for Tracing of Certain Human, Finished, Prescription Drugs Guidance for Industry">DSCSA Standards for the Interoperable Exchange of Information for Tracing of Certain Human, Finished, Prescription Drugs Guidance for Industry</a></td><td><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/public-inspection/2023-19182/guidance-drug-supply-chain-security-act-standards-for-the-interoperable-exchange-of-information-for">Notice of Availability</a></td></tr><tr><td>9/1/2023</td><td>Final Guidance Compliance Policy</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/wholesale-distributor-verification-requirement-saleable-returned-drug-product-and-dispenser-0" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2566a8f4-437f-4ac4-862f-a18712f46e0b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Wholesale Distributor Verification Requirement for Saleable Returned Drug Product and Dispenser Verification Requirements When Investigating a Suspect or Illegitimate Product—Compliance Policies">Wholesale Distributor Verification Requirement for Saleable Returned Drug Product and Dispenser Verification Requirements When Investigating a Suspect or Illegitimate Product — Compliance Policies</a></td><td><p><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/09/01/2023-18899/wholesale-distributor-verification-requirement-for-saleable-returned-drug-product-and-dispenser">Notice of Availability</a></p><p><a href="/drugs/drug-alerts-and-statements/dscsa-compliance-policies-establish-1-year-stabilization-period-implementing-electronic-systems" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1d9895f6-1624-43da-93e7-27fa2f9fc77e" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="DSCSA compliance policies establish 1-year stabilization period for implementing electronic systems">FDA Statement: DSCSA compliance policies establish 1-year stabilization period for implementing electronic systems</a></p></td></tr><tr><td>8/31/2023</td><td>Final Guidance</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/enhanced-drug-distribution-security-package-level-under-drug-supply-chain-security-act" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="82b55e64-6b4b-4805-bde5-28babd1d246a" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Enhanced Drug Distribution Security at the Package Level Under the Drug Supply Chain Security Act">Enhanced Drug Distribution Security at the Package Level Under the Drug Supply Chain Security Act</a></td><td><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/08/31/2023-18831/enhanced-drug-distribution-security-at-the-package-level-under-the-drug-supply-chain-security-act">Notice of Availability</a></td></tr><tr><td>8/28/2023</td><td>Final Guidance Compliance Policy</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/enhanced-drug-distribution-security-requirements-under-section-582g1-federal-food-drug-and-cosmetic" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d9c95391-a273-4235-ab18-68caed6498dc" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Enhanced Drug Distribution Security Requirements Under Section 582(g)(1) of the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act--Compliance Policies">Enhanced Drug Distribution Security Requirements Under Section 582(g)(1) of the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act — Compliance Policies</a></td><td><p><a href="https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2023/08/28/2023-18359/enhanced-drug-distribution-security-requirements-under-section-582g1-of-the-federal-food-drug-and">Notice of Availability</a></p><p><a href="/drugs/drug-alerts-and-statements/dscsa-compliance-policies-establish-1-year-stabilization-period-implementing-electronic-systems" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1d9895f6-1624-43da-93e7-27fa2f9fc77e" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="DSCSA compliance policies establish 1-year stabilization period for implementing electronic systems">FDA Statement: DSCSA compliance policies establish 1-year stabilization period for implementing electronic systems</a></p></td></tr><tr><td>8/4/2023</td><td>Final Guidance</td><td><a href="/regulatory-information/search-fda-guidance-documents/waivers-exceptions-and-exemptions-requirements-section-582-federal-food-drug-and-cosmetic-act" data-entity-typ